      "alt": "Starterkit STKa57xx",
      "text": "<h1>Arm® Cortex®-A15 based on AM57xx</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKa57xx is a comprehensive evaluation kit designed for embedded computing engineers. It is built around the TQMa57xx platform, featuring the Arm Cortex-A15 processor derived from the AM57xx series. The kit offers high-definition graphics support and excels in high-speed communication, providing up to 2x Gigabit Ethernet, 4x real-time Ethernet 10/100-Base, 2x PCIe, 1x USB 3.0, and 1x USB 2.0 OTG with CAN-FD support. Notably, it maintains low power consumption at around 4 watts, making it an energy-efficient solution. Additionally, it incorporates integrated security functions and supports IEEE 1588 hardware, enhancing data protection and precise time synchronization for reliable operations.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 23:29:01 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
